### Notes
- Used INNER JOIN to match orders with products on product_id == id
- Revenue computed as price * quantity before filtering
- Filtered for status == "completed" to keep only completed orders
- Grouped by product name with SUM(revenue) AS total_revenue
- All semicolons placed per CRITICAL SYNTAX RULE requirements

